WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.932
Want to launch telehealth under your own brand, without building a medical stack? Meet Rx-Dr.

2
00:00:06.382 --> 00:00:08.652
Your storefront. Your name, your colors.

3
00:00:09.102 --> 00:00:14.395
Set up your brand in minutes. Name, logo and palette flow to every page and every email.

4
00:00:14.845 --> 00:00:18.311
Patients start online, with an intake that adapts as they answer.

5
00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:24.427
Every visit lands in a licensed clinician's queue, with the intake summary and compliance checks ready.

6
00:00:24.877 --> 00:00:28.821
One click to approve, and the prescription goes straight to a partner pharmacy.

7
00:00:29.271 --> 00:00:34.736
Pharmacy status syncs back automatically, so your team and your patients always know where things stand.

8
00:00:35.186 --> 00:00:41.135
Payments, memberships, subscriptions and refills run on autopilot, and partner payouts follow your rules.

9
00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:46.872
Patients get a portal in your brand: messages, order tracking and refills, all in one place.

10
00:00:47.322 --> 00:00:53.202
Every role gets its own portal: brand, clinic, clinician, pharmacy, patient and referral partner.

11
00:00:53.652 --> 00:01:01.487
HIPAA is built in. Every record access is logged, emergency access is break-glass, and sensitive changes need two approvers.

12
00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:06.817
Built and launched by Ardn Cloud Solutions. Book a call, and your brand could be live in weeks.
